### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/
Content-Type: application/json


### Signup User
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bhaskar",
  "email": "bhas@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


### Login User
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bhas@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}


