### Get Logged-in User Profile
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Checkout (Protected Route)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Yard Special",
      "price": 15,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "total": 15,
  "deliveryAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main St",
    "city": "Sydney",
    "state": "NSW",
    "postcode": "2000"
  }
}
